
### Categories
GET {{settings.CONTENT_URL}}/categories


### Category details
GET {{settings.CONTENT_URL}}/categories/{{category_name}}

### Category images
GET {{settings.HOST}}/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/images

### Category voices
GET {{settings.HOST}}/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/voices


### Items
GET {{settings.HOST}}/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items

### Item details
GET {{settings.HOST}}/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items/{{item_id}}

### Item images
GET {{settings.HOST}}/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items/{{item_id}}/images

### Item voices
GET {{settings.HOST}}/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items/{{item_id}}/voices




